        <h1 class="hero__title"><span>Issues Index: 2018 onwards</span>
</h1>

                  <div class="hero__description">Q What would you say is the most important issue facing Britain today? Q What do you see as other important issues facing Britain today? (Unprompted - combined answers)</div>
        
        
                  <div class="hero__date">
            <time datetime="04.10.22">04.10.22</time>
          </div>
        
