<section class="block-publications-content">
  <div class="block-wysiwyg wysiwyg">
    <div class="container">
      
      
      
            <p><strong>Q</strong> What would you say is the most important issue facing Britain today?<br>
<strong>Q</strong> What do you see as other important issues facing Britain today? (Unprompted - combined answers)</p>

<p>An '*' (asterisk) indicates a finding of less than 0.5%, but greater than zero.</p>

<p>Abbreviations: rollover each abbreviation for the full title.</p>

